 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He wrote a word of thanks to friends who'd sent him help again",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was writing from a prison, he was sitting there in chains",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He had known the crowded table and he'd known the empty bowl",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But whatever came, a quiet strength was rooted in his soul",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have learned to be content whatever my circumstances",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I can do all things through him who gives me strength",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I can do all things",
